	(text "2764/27128: pin27 is PGM#, NOT A14. 27256: pin27 is A14.\nDo not route a 595 output onto a VPP pin. Use keyed jumpers or a device-specific adapter.\nVPP on pin1 needs READ +5V selection, separate from the onboard NM27C512 relay.\nRead-only adapters may tie VPP and unused PGM# HIGH. WRITE remains disabled for these profiles.\nSources: National NM27C512 and Intel 2764 / 27128A / 27256 original datasheets."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 170 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "60fc3bfc-a5f9-516f-89cc-9d361a640861")
	)
